<title>PHILIPPINES: Benpres unit raises capital for expansion.</title>
<headline>Benpres unit raises capital for expansion.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockholders of Express Telecommunications Inc (Extelcom) approved on Wednesday a proposed increase in the authorised capital of the cellular phone firm to two billion pesos from 250 million pesos.</p>
<p>Extelcom is 46.62 percent owned by Bayantel, a unit of conglomerate Benpres Holdings Corp.</p>
<p>Extelcom officials said the increase in the firm's authorised capital was necessary for the expansion of its cellsite expansion nationwide.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
